<rml><head><link type="text/rcss" href="../../themes/prime.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="../../components/controls.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="maps.rcss"/></head><body><div id="map_panel"><h1>CHOOSE MAP</h1><button id="map_close" data-action="lobby:map-close">CLOSE</button><div id="map_status"/><div id="map_grid"><button id="map_choice0" class="map_card" data-action="lobby:map-select:0"><img id="map_image0"/><b id="map_name0"/><span id="map_hint0"/></button><button id="map_choice1" class="map_card" data-action="lobby:map-select:1"><img id="map_image1"/><b id="map_name1"/><span id="map_hint1"/></button><button id="map_choice2" class="map_card" data-action="lobby:map-select:2"><img id="map_image2"/><b id="map_name2"/><span id="map_hint2"/></button><button id="map_choice3" class="map_card" data-action="lobby:map-select:3"><img id="map_image3"/><b id="map_name3"/><span id="map_hint3"/></button><button id="map_choice4" class="map_card" data-action="lobby:map-select:4"><img id="map_image4"/><b id="map_name4"/><span id="map_hint4"/></button><button id="map_choice5" class="map_card" data-action="lobby:map-select:5"><img id="map_image5"/><b id="map_name5"/><span id="map_hint5"/></button></div><div id="map_pager"><button id="map_previous" data-action="lobby:map-previous">PREVIOUS</button><span id="map_page"/><button id="map_next" data-action="lobby:map-next">NEXT</button></div></div></body></rml>